{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f2c002aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 2110,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 650,
      "label": "Boundary values and information loss · 边界值与信息丢失"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1c001aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 650,
      "label": "Geometry of constraints · 约束的几何"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 1660,
      "label": "空间语言",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 6600,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 800,
      "label": "方程组解结构",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000003",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 7900,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 1110,
      "label": "矩阵乘积与秩",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000004",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 3800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2600,
      "height": 1800,
      "label": "消元与求基",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000005",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 6600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 1530,
      "label": "秩与四空间",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000006",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 1200,
      "label": "逆矩阵与求逆",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "20000000000000ff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 9600,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# 线性方程组与四个基本子空间\n\n先建立空间、线性无关、张成、基与维数的语言，再把 $Ax=b$ 拆成列空间的可达性与零空间的唯一性。消元用主元、自由变量和 RREF 计算解并构造各空间的基；同一套行操作也能用 Gauss–Jordan 方法求逆。秩与四个基本子空间解释这些计算的整体结构，矩阵乘积则从 $Ax$ 延伸到多列与低秩结构。箭头的具体关系以标签为准：它可能表示前置、推出、分类或计算方法。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000032",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[向量空间]]\n\n向量空间是允许加法和数乘、并满足线性运算公理的集合。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000018",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[线性无关]]\n\n只有全零系数能组合出零向量，说明这组方向没有冗余。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000019",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[张成]]\n\n一组向量的全部线性组合构成它们的张成；覆盖目标空间就是能够表示其中每个向量。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "## [[子空间]]\n\n子空间包含零向量，并对任意线性组合封闭。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[线性无关与张成|Independence and spanning]]\n\nIndependence gives at most one coefficient representation; spanning gives at least one for every target in the specified space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n线性无关保证至多一种系数表示；张成保证指定空间的每个目标至少有一种表示。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000044",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[子空间并集判据|When a union is a subspace]]\n\nFor two subspaces of the same vector space, the union is a subspace exactly when one contains the other.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一向量空间内两个子空间的并仍为子空间，恰要求一方包含另一方。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[基]]\n\n一组基既线性无关又张成整个空间，是一套刚好够用的坐标方向。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000020",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 1400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[维数]]\n\n有限维空间任一组基所含向量的共同数目，就是这个空间的维数。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7140,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[零空间]]\n\n$N(A)=\\{x:Ax=0\\}$ 收集所有被 $A$ 映成零的输入方向。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7240,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[Ax的列组合解释]]\n\n$Ax$ 是 $A$ 的列按 $x$ 的坐标加权后的线性组合；列空间就是全部可达输出。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6660,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[方程组解分类]]\n\n$b\\in C(A)$ 决定是否有解，$N(A)=\\{0\\}$ 决定相容时是否唯一。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6915,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[特解加零空间]]\n\n相容系统的完整解集是 $x_p+N(A)$：一个特解加上全部齐次方向。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[矩阵乘积逐列作用]]\n\n$AB$ 的每一列都是 $A$ 作用于 $B$ 的对应列，因此 $C(AB)\\subseteq C(A)$。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000045",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8500,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[矩阵乘积逐行作用]]\n\n$AB$ 的每一行都是 $B$ 的各行按 $A$ 对应行的系数形成的线性组合。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000046",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8250,
      "y": 2280,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[矩阵乘积秩上界]]\n\n$\\operatorname{rank}(AB)$ 不超过 $A$ 与 $B$ 的秩中较小的一个。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000029",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 2620,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[矩阵乘积外积展开]]\n\n矩阵乘积可以按共同的中间指标，写成左矩阵各列与右矩阵对应各行的外积之和。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8500,
      "y": 2620,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[秩一矩阵外积刻画]]\n\n非零矩阵秩为一，当且仅当它能写成两个非零向量的一个外积。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3860,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[初等矩阵]]\n\n对单位矩阵做一次初等行操作得到 $E$；左乘 $E$ 会对目标矩阵执行同一行操作。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4820,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[行操作的解集不变性]]\n\n对增广矩阵 $[A\\mid b]$ 同步施行可逆行操作，所得方程组与原方程组具有相同解集。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000042",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4320,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[行等价]]\n\n若一个矩阵能由另一个矩阵经过有限次初等行操作得到，两者就行等价。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000030",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5320,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[高斯消元]]\n\n用可逆行操作建立主元、得到阶梯形，再通过回代求解。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5360,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[消元与LU分解]]\n\n无换行消元把乘子保存为 $L$、结果保存为 $U$；换行时用 $P$ 记录置换，得到 $PA=LU$。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3860,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[行最简形]]\n\nRREF 要求每个主元为一、主元列其余元素为零，并且各主元从上到下严格右移。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000047",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3860,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[RREF存在唯一性]]\n\n每个矩阵都行等价于一个行最简形，而且这个行最简形由原矩阵唯一确定。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4510,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[主元与自由变量]]\n\n主元数等于秩；非主元变量是自由变量，给出 $n-r$ 个自由度。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4510,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[RREF读取子空间基]]\n\nRREF 对四个基本子空间提供的证据不同，因此每个空间要采用相应的读取规则。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3860,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[RREF读取列空间基]]\n\n用 RREF 找主元列的位置，再回到原矩阵取对应列。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000026",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4480,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[RREF读取行空间基]]\n\nRREF 的非零行直接构成原矩阵行空间的一组基。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000027",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5100,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[RREF读取零空间基]]\n\n解 $Rx=0$，逐个激活自由变量，所得特殊解构成 $N(A)$ 的一组基。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000028",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5720,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[消元追踪左零空间基]]\n\n同步化简 $[A\\mid I]$ 到 $[R\\mid E]$；与 $R$ 零行对应的 $E$ 行转置构成 $N(A^T)$ 的一组基。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000036",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4360,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[主元]]\n\n阶梯形中每个非零行最左边的非零元是主元；它标出一条独立约束。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000037",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4860,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[自由变量]]\n\n非主元列对应自由变量；系统相容时，它们可以作为解的参数自由选取。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000038",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5800,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[置换矩阵]]\n\n置换矩阵由单位矩阵重新排列各行得到；左乘它会重排目标矩阵的行。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000039",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[逆矩阵|Inverse matrix]]\n\nA square matrix has an inverse $B$ when $BA=AB=I$: either composition undoes the original action.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n方阵的双侧逆在两个复合方向都撤销原作用；信息丢失时不存在逆。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000040",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[逆矩阵唯一性|Uniqueness of an inverse]]\n\nIf $B$ and $C$ are two-sided inverses, $B=B(AC)=(BA)C=C$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n结合律把两个候选逆连接起来；矩形矩阵的单侧逆不自动唯一。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000041",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[Gauss-Jordan求逆]]\n\n同步化简 $[A\\mid I]$；若左块成为 $I$，右块就是 $A^{-1}$，否则 $A$ 不可逆。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000033",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6660,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[列空间]]\n\n$C(A)$ 是全部列线性组合，也就是所有 $Ax$；它位于输出空间。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000035",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8100,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[左零空间]]\n\n对实矩阵，$N(A^T)$ 收集满足 $A^Ty=0$ 的输出侧约束方向。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7620,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[行空间]]\n\n行空间是全部行向量的线性组合，位于输入空间。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000021",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6660,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[矩阵秩]]\n\n矩阵的秩是列空间的维数，表示能够产生多少个独立输出方向。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000022",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7160,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[零度]]\n\n零度是零空间的维数，表示有多少个独立输入方向被映成零。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000023",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6660,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[行秩等于列秩]]\n\n任意矩阵的行空间与列空间维数相同，但不能据此认定二者是同一空间。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7380,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## [[秩零度定理]]\n\n对 $m\\times n$ 矩阵，秩加零度等于定义域维数 $n$。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7950,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[四个基本子空间]]\n\n列空间与左零空间位于输出侧，行空间与零空间位于输入侧；每一侧各由一对互补的方向构成。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8700,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[基本子空间正交补]]\n\n对实矩阵，行空间与零空间、列空间与左零空间分别互为正交补。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9040,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## [[左零空间相容性]]\n\n对实矩阵，$Ax=b$ 可解，当且仅当 $b$ 与左零空间中的每个方向都正交。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2000000000000043",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8580,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[行操作与四个子空间]]\n\n若 $R=EA$ 且 $E$ 可逆，零空间与行空间不变；列空间和左零空间则分别随 $E$ 与 $E^{-T}$ 变换。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "20000000000000a1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8500,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 正交补前置\n\n[[正交]] → [[正交补]]\n\n先定义正交与正交补，才能把两对基本子空间提升为正交补关系。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "20000000000000fe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3100,
      "width": 9600,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## 接下来往哪里走\n\n没有精确解时，用 [[正交投影与最小二乘.canvas|正交投影与最小二乘]] 找最接近的可达输出；研究方阵的可逆性与体积变化时进入 [[行列式.canvas|行列式]]；研究同一线性变换在不同坐标中的表示时进入 [[线性变换与换基.canvas|线性变换与换基]]；秩亏系统需要规范解时进入 [[广义逆与最小范数解.canvas|广义逆与最小范数解]]。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1c001aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[方程组的行图像|Row picture · 行图像]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe solution set is the intersection of the equation solution sets.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n解集是各行方程解集的交。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1c001aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "## [[独立约束与自由度|Independent constraints · 独立约束]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAn independent new row removes one degree of freedom from a consistent system.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n对相容系统，新增独立行使解集维数减少一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2c002aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 2210,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[固定初值的差分反演|Cumulative sums with an initial value · 固定初值的差分反演]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA known initial value makes cumulative sums recover every original level.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n已知初值后，累加差值可唯一恢复原水平。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2c002aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2590,
      "y": 2470,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[非零齐次解与不可逆|Nonzero homogeneous solutions rule out an inverse · 非零齐次解与不可逆]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA nonzero vector mapped to zero reveals lost information and prevents unique recovery.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n非零向量被映到零说明信息丢失，无法唯一恢复输入。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c004aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 3800,
      "y": 1850,
      "width": 2500,
      "height": 1050,
      "label": "Multiplication rules · 矩阵乘法规则"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c004aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4700,
      "y": 1970,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵乘法|Matrix multiplication]]\n\nFor $A:m\\times n$ and $B:n\\times p$, $AB:m\\times p$. In $A(Bx)$, $B$ acts first.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n内侧尺寸匹配，逐行乘列求和；复合作用先右后左。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c004aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 2520,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵乘法分配律|Distributive laws]]\n\nFor compatible sizes, $A(B+C)=AB+AC$ and $(A+B)C=AC+BC$, preserving factor order.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n尺寸匹配后展开加法；不能交换矩阵因子次序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4c004aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5450,
      "y": 2520,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[分块矩阵乘法|Block multiplication]]\n\nAlign the inner partition boundaries, then sum compatible block products across the shared block index.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n内部分割边界必须一致；分块后仍沿共同指标求和。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 9900,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 2600,
      "label": "Inverse rules and reusable factors · 求逆规则与分解复用"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[乘积的逆矩阵|Inverse of a product]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUndo the factors in reverse order.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n各因子按相反次序撤销。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[下三角乘积封闭性|Lower triangular products]]\n\nSame-size lower triangular matrices have a lower triangular product. If both have unit diagonals, their product does too.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同尺寸下三角矩阵的乘积仍下三角；两个因子均为单位对角时，乘积也如此。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[LDU分解|Separate the pivots]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nExtract nonzero pivots into a diagonal factor.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n把非零主元提取为对角因子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[LU分解复用成本|Reuse LU factors]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFactor once in cubic work; solve each new right-hand side in quadratic work.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n分解一次需立方量级，每个新右端需平方量级。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵转置|Matrix transpose]]\n\nAn $m\\times n$ matrix becomes $n\\times m$ by exchanging row and column indices; ordinary transpose does not conjugate.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n交换行列位置和尺寸；普通转置不取复共轭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[乘积的转置|Transpose of a product]]\n\nFor compatible matrices, $(AB)^T=B^TA^T$: reverse the factor order as well as transposing each factor.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n乘积转置必须同时交换因子次序；无需方阵或可逆条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c005aabbcc0008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10750,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "## [[转置与求逆可交换|Transpose and inverse]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor an invertible matrix, the two operations commute.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n对可逆矩阵，两种操作可以交换次序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 9900,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 2500,
      "label": "Permutations, symmetry and spaces · 置换、对称与空间"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 3040,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[循环置换的周期|Cycle length and return]]\n\nA single cycle returns after its length, even with extra fixed rows.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n单个循环的周期等于循环长度；额外固定行不改变它。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 3040,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[转置乘积的对称性|Symmetric transpose products]]\n\nFor real $A:m\\times n$, $A^TA$ is symmetric $n\\times n$ and $AA^T$ is symmetric $m\\times m$. Neither is automatically invertible.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实矩阵与自身转置相乘得到对称矩阵，两种次序尺寸可能不同，也不保证可逆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[实反对称矩阵|Real skew-symmetric matrices]]\n\nFor a real square matrix, $A^T=-A$: mirrored entries have opposite signs and every diagonal entry is zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实方阵的转置等于其负矩阵：镜像元素互为相反数，对角元全部为零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对称矩阵的自由参数|Dimension of the symmetric matrix space]]\n\nFor real symmetric $n\\times n$ matrices, the diagonal and one strict triangle give $n(n+1)/2$ independent coordinates.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实 n 阶对称矩阵的对角线和一个严格三角区域给出 n(n+1)/2 个独立坐标。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 4240,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[反对称矩阵的自由参数|Dimension of the skew-symmetric matrix space]]\n\nFor real skew-symmetric $n\\times n$ matrices, one strict triangle gives $n(n-1)/2$ coordinates; the diagonal is forced to zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实 n 阶反对称矩阵只有一个严格三角区域可自由选择，对角线固定为零，维数为 n(n−1)/2。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 4240,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[转置等式定义的矩阵子空间|Transpose constraints and subspaces]]\n\nFix either $A^T=A$ for the whole family or $A^T=-A$ for the whole family. Transpose linearity preserves that condition under linear combinations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整个矩阵族固定同一种正号或负号转置条件；转置的线性性使线性组合保留该条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10000,
      "y": 4840,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[低维欧氏空间的子空间|Low-dimensional real subspaces]]\n\nOver the real scalars: $\\{0\\}$, lines through zero, planes through zero where available, and the full ambient space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实数域上：零子空间、过原点的整条直线、维数允许时过原点的整片平面，以及整个环境空间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6c006aabbcc0009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": 4840,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[列图像与列空间|Column picture and column space]]\n\nInterpret one column combination; collect all possible output vectors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n解释列组合的视角；收集所有输出的集合。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3500,
      "width": 2500,
      "height": 1100,
      "label": "Operations on subspaces · 子空间的集合运算"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 3630,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[子空间的交集|Intersection of subspaces]]\n\nA vector must satisfy both membership conditions.\n向量必须同时属于两边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 3630,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[子空间之和|Sum of subspaces]]\n\nAdd one vector from each subspace.\n从两边各取一个向量相加。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 4100,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[子空间和与并集的张成|The sum is the span of the union]]\n\nClose the union under all linear combinations.\n将并集扩充到对任意线性组合封闭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7c007aabbcc0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 4100,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "## [[纵向拼接的零空间|Nullspace of a vertical stack]]\n\nStacking imposes both homogeneous systems on the same input.\n上下拼接对同一输入同时施加两组齐次约束。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c008aabbcc0001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 3500,
      "width": 3300,
      "height": 650,
      "label": "Homogeneous solutions and coordinate order · 齐次解与坐标顺序"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c008aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "[[零空间矩阵|Nullspace matrix]]\n零空间矩阵\n\nCollect a basis as columns; all solutions are x = Nc.\n把基并排组成列，任意系数给出全部齐次解。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c008aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3980,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "[[列置换后的解向量|Restore coordinates after column permutation]]\n列置换后的解坐标\n\n(AQ)z = b corresponds to Ax = b with x = Qz.\n变量重排后，必须恢复原来的分量标签。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c008aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5060,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "[[矩阵乘积为零|Zero product and nullspace]]\n零乘积与零空间\n\nAB = 0 iff C(B) is contained in N(A).\n右因子的每个输出，都被左因子映成零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9c009aabbcc0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6600,
      "y": 3500,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "[[全部右端的解集确定矩阵|Equal solution sets for every identical right-hand side]]\n全部右端的解集确定矩阵\n\nHolding each b fixed forces equality of the two matrices.\n对每个固定的 b 要求解集相同，就确定了矩阵。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fac010aabbcc0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8520,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 950,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## [[按生成向量检验正交|Test a spanning set · 检验生成向量]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nZero dot products with every generator extend to every vector in its span.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n对所有生成向量检验点积为零，即可覆盖整个张成空间。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc011aabbcc0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 4800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[上三角与对称矩阵的交集|Upper triangular and symmetric]]\n\nFor real $n\\times n$ matrices, these two constraints together give exactly the diagonal matrices, a space of dimension $n$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实 n 阶矩阵同时上三角且对称，当且仅当它为对角矩阵；这个空间维数为 n。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 5800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵空间|Matrix space]]\n\nAn entire matrix is one vector.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整个矩阵是一个向量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 5800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[子空间维数公式|Dimension of a subspace sum]]\n\nCount shared directions once.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n共同方向只计数一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 5800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[矩阵左乘映射的秩与零度|Rank and nullity of left multiplication]]\n\nEach input column can vary freely; matrix-space dimensions count the choices across all columns.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n各输入列可分别自由变化；矩阵空间的维数要合计所有列的自由度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 6220,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[固定秩矩阵集合|Fixed-rank matrix sets]]\n\nCheck zero and closure under addition.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n检查零矩阵与加法封闭性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fbc012aabbcc0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 6220,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[秩分解与秩一展开|Minimal rank-one decomposition]]\n\nRank is the minimum number of rank-one terms; a rank factorization constructs them.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n秩等于秩一展开的最少项数；秩分解提供达到这个数的构造。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0010-direct-sum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 6220,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[直和|Direct sum]]\n\nEach vector in the sum has a unique decomposition into one component from each subspace; perpendicularity is not required.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n和空间中每个向量的各子空间分量都唯一；不要求垂直。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0012-triangular",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 4800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[三角矩阵|Triangular matrix]]\n\nA square matrix is upper triangular when entries below the diagonal vanish, and lower triangular when those above vanish.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n上三角在主对角线下方全零，下三角在上方全零；对角元允许为零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0012-diagonal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 4800,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对角矩阵|Diagonal matrix]]\n\nOnly diagonal positions may be nonzero. A square diagonal matrix scales each coordinate separately.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非对角位置全零；对角方阵逐个缩放坐标。矩形扩展须保留尺寸。"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "3000000000000001",
      "fromNode": "2000000000000032",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "2000000000000018",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "用系数关系检验冗余"
    },
    {
